# Device-verification artifacts. All of them are regenerated on demand by
# mobile/scripts/verify-device.sh and mobile/scripts/run-acceptance.sh, so they are not source.
#
# UI dumps (.xml) and their readable renderings (.txt) are pure intermediates — ignore them.
# Screenshots (.png) are kept in the tree, because a screenshot is often the only evidence a
# reviewer can actually look at, and it is what a manual step is documented against.
*.xml
*.txt
sample-photos/
# The harness's cached dev access token — a live JWT for the test account. Never commit it.
# (It was tracked until the round-2 wrap-up untracked it. Keep this rule.)
.dev-token
